+        # minted with that mechanism's own primitives, so the record is one the
+        # implementation itself accepts: its own key, its own canonical path form,
+        # its own digests, its own tag construction.  That is the strongest form of
+        # the attack and the one a same-account writer can always mount, which is
+        # why no such mechanism may decide what is deleted or published.
